WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
The school council is planning a survey.

2
00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.890
They want sixty responses.

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.650
The school has twelve hundred
pupils in five year groups:

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.350
two hundred and sixty,
two hundred and forty,

5
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.070
two hundred and forty,
two hundred and twenty,

6
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.010
and two hundred and forty.

7
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.890
The results must be fair across the years.

8
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.940
So how many should come from each year?

9
00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.670
The same number from every year?

10
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.510
Or just whoever volunteers first?

11
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.890
In this mission, you'll split a
population into groups called strata.

12
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:35.050
You'll build a sample that keeps
each group in proportion to its size.

13
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.530
And you'll see what the fraction sixty
over twelve hundred has to do with it.

14
00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.040
Your mission: work out how many
pupils to ask from each year group.
